S1  x1v - rbar = 2*h**2*rbar/(h**2 + 12*rbar**2)  = -h**4/(72*rbar**3) + h**2/(6*rbar)
S2  upwind-5: face value - a(r_f) = h^2 * [c1/(6*rbar)] + O(h^3)   (c1 = a'; = delta_v a')
S2  central-6: face value - a(r_f) = h^2 * [c1/(6*rbar)] + O(h^3)   (c1 = a'; = delta_v a')
S2  scan step - exact step = d1*g*h**3/(6*rbar)   (= g h delta_v rho', so the scanned faces sit at r_f + delta_v)
S3  code - exact pressure force = c2*h**2/(3*rbar)   (c2 = p''/2: = +delta_v p'' + O(h^4))
